<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S3.SS6" title="In C Ablation Studies ‣ Diffusion Mental Averages" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">C.6 </span>Effects of Number of Noisy Latents (<math class="ltx_Math" alttext="K" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>K</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">K</annotation></semantics></math>)</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S3.SS7" title="In C Ablation Studies ‣ Diffusion Mental Averages" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">C.7 </span>DiT Semantic Layer Selection</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S4a" title="In Diffusion Mental Averages" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">D </span>Implementation Details of D<sup class="ltx_sup">4</sup>M and MGD<sup class="ltx_sup">3</sup></span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S5a" title="In Diffusion Mental Averages" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">E </span>Additional Results</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_section">
