<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S5.SS2a" title="In E Additional Results ‣ Diffusion Mental Averages" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">E.2 </span>Qualitative Results</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
