</section>
<section id="S5.SS2a" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">E.2 </span>Qualitative Results</h3>

<div id="S5.SS2a.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="S5.SS2a.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S5.SS2a.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Average Images.</span> Additional results for average images of more concepts are shown in Figure <a href="#S5.F21" title="Figure 21 ‣ E.2 Qualitative Results ‣ E Additional Results ‣ Diffusion Mental Averages" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">21</span></a>-<a href="#S5.F24" title="Figure 24 ‣ E.2 Qualitative Results ‣ E Additional Results ‣ Diffusion Mental Averages" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">24</span></a>.</p>
</div>
