<div id="S5.SS2a.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="S5.SS2a.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S5.SS2a.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Mode Discovery.</span> Additional results for mode discovery using DMA with LoRA are shown in Figure <a href="#S5.F25" title="Figure 25 ‣ E.2 Qualitative Results ‣ E Additional Results ‣ Diffusion Mental Averages" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">25</span></a>-<a href="#S5.F34" title="Figure 34 ‣ E.2 Qualitative Results ‣ E Additional Results ‣ Diffusion Mental Averages" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">34</span></a>.</p>
</div>
