<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S5.F25.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 25</span>: </span><span id="S5.F25.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Cluster averages for the <span id="S5.F25.7.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Bicycle</span> concept grounded by <span id="S5.F25.7.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">color</span>.<span id="S5.F25.7.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">
Top: Diffusion samples grouped into clusters according to the grounding attribute <span id="S5.F25.7.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">color</span>.
Bottom: Cluster averages computed by DMA with LoRA.
These averages highlight how our method captures the dominant visual characteristics within each cluster.</span></span></figcaption>
</figure>
