<span id="S5.T3.17" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Person</span> — Astronaut, Doctor, Firefighter;
<span id="S5.T3.18" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Object</span> — Bicycle, Car, TV Monitor;
<span id="S5.T3.19" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Abstract</span> — Anger, Freedom, Poverty.
</figcaption>
